# The screenshot goldens, in LFS. They are large binaries rewritten in full on every
# UI change; without LFS each refresh adds the whole set to history, permanently, in
# every clone — and an unversioned baseline is only ever "whatever this machine
# captured last", which is not a gate.
#
# Beside Armada.xcodeproj rather than at the repo root, because these patterns are
# relative to this file's own directory: hoisted, the rule silently stops matching and
# the next refresh commits the goldens as plain blobs. `*/` is the platform level and
# `**` any device or locale level under it. manifest.json is deliberately not matched —
# it is the seal, and it is text.
Screenshots/*/golden/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
